Managed browser reference provenance
------------------------------------

The managed browser adapter refers to OpenCode commit
6bffe7932efa9adc36b74e389598daecb4b17ac1 for browser RPC, Chromium/CDP,
AX observations, and native image output semantics. The DAC managed adapter
is independently implemented against DAC Session/Permission/canonical Tool
contracts. The upstream MIT notice above is retained; this reference does not
imply endorsement or compatibility with every upstream operation.

