JuggleIM protected reader SDK
=============================

DeepAgent Code includes @deepagent-code/im-kernel-sdk, derived from
JuggleIM im-web-sdk 1.9.17, source commit
f69cbe450fc79fceac7ae24a54baee57f9b1a5c3.
https://github.com/Juggleim/im-web-sdk

Original LICENSE/package metadata: Apache-2.0. The original generated MIT
banner is retained unchanged; the differing upstream notices are documented
in packages/im-kernel-sdk/NOTICE. Readable source, original build scripts,
locked tools, attribution and LICENSE are distributed with the workspace
package. DAC changes add durable receipts, bounded protected reader queries,
exact decimal int64 handling and immutable protected reader mode.
